    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The default value is 1.0, which means that a version of this image that ARKit recognizes in the physical environment exactly matches its reference image [`physicalSize`](arreferenceimage/physicalsize.md).",
      "ko": "The framework clamps this to between `0` and `30` Hz.",
      "sourceHash": "00daf6b13a8e828136ea12021bcc4f5ed06ad3d6b4772e78b7e1295a4302df72",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "Otherwise, ARKit automatically corrects the image anchor’s transform when `estimatedScaleFactor` is a value other than 1.0.",
      "ko": "반대로 `estimatedScaleFactor`가 1.0이 아닌 값이면 ARKit가 이미지 앵커의 transform을 자동으로 보정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "620892edfa19f10e9050ea708c2afd7fb4f9aed4059a577ee4bce3d803ecd01d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "This adjustment in turn, corrects ARKit’s understanding of where the image anchor is located in the physical environment.",
      "ko": "이 보정은 다시 ARKit가 물리적 환경에서 이미지 앵커의 위치를 인식하는 방식을 정정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "e129a1904338a1d72b6849532b941ef350a1e649ed9daa75b6e13db236e7a2a9",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "See [`automaticImageScaleEstimationEnabled`](arworldtrackingconfiguration/automaticimagescaleestimationenabled.md).",
      "ko": "참조: [`automaticImageScaleEstimationEnabled`](arworldtrackingconfiguration/automaticimagescaleestimationenabled.md).",
      "sourceHash": "bd67c8aafd4d2dfa5d4b958741d34e3d9e712746eacd03e0ca9287096ca959f4",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
